# Records docs/demo.gif with VHS (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs):
#   npm run build && vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1280
Set Height 640
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Env PORT "3000"

Type "node examples/demo.mjs"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
